## Quick Start

Save the four files in one folder, open `index.html` in your browser, and you're ready to go. Here's a summary of what each piece does:

| File | Responsibility |
|---|---|
| **`index.html`** | Semantic structure — header, form, filter bar, 3-column board, empty state |
| **`styles.css`** | CSS custom properties for theming, responsive grid layout, card animations, status color accents |
| **`app.js`** | State management, localStorage I/O, CRUD operations, filtering, DOM rendering, event delegation |
| **`README.md`** | Setup instructions and architecture overview |

The app uses a **single source of truth** (`tasks` array) — every action (add, delete, toggle, filter) mutates that array, saves to localStorage, and re-renders the board. Event delegation on the task board keeps the DOM interaction code minimal and clean.

